  "description": "Authority inversion with an outbound action. The text tells the agent to disregard or override the user's own request and then move data to an external destination, the three elements within 64 gap characters of each other in total and never across a blank line, where a line break that is not followed by a blank line counts as one gap character. Separated from GLS-PI-POLITE-001 because the addressee here is the instruction to overrule the user rather than a greeting, and it should be reportable on its own.",
  "keywords": [
    "disregard user request outbound",
    "override request outbound"
  ],
